  <item>
    <title>EP.014 我得旅行，才有灵感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650af5305c88d24126667aab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650af5305c88d24126667aab</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Sep 2023 13:35:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于等来了中国内地首个亨利·马蒂斯的艺术大展！！已经在北京UCCA尤伦斯当代艺术中心开幕了近两个多月的“马蒂斯的马蒂斯”展览里呈现了马蒂斯的色彩、剪纸、版画、雕塑、书籍等不同类型的艺术作品，展现着马蒂斯的艺术创作生涯的探索轨迹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三位在京的主播已经先后去观看了展览，另一位远在长沙的阿猪，被展览热度和展览内容吊起了兴趣，就这样隔空连线，盘问起了展览的情况。索性，我们决定唠一期“马蒂斯的马蒂斯”，给阿猪讲讲展览内容，跟大家讨论讨论观后感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️这期唠到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 展览的基本情况</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiaKc30cUGYamQPnTAXV29_NXHWK.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（展览现场）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 到底谁是马蒂斯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 马蒂斯和他的野兽派</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJc5s9Lk5M59UpfPgWUkGQS0bS3.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（不在展览里）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 孩子最喜欢他的教堂了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlEjoedOnvhTALAKNimlHg1K38YH.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnnUZrsgf0t94LU780QHDfjtUyfS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 是什么让马蒂斯有着源源不断的灵感？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7_ioXVQmKP7sxrhIvSAl-MCotP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlCyocgKg55liazmozLtPfL35vwi.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a> 纯粹的线条</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm8IVajNRRnOCM7k5br9OLVEGrR7.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg7wmIV6RTx1yBGQBzp2hTIy-LH3.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 流动性与音乐性</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjtbssJqOH2kvq320V6aPFXgrW8R.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3qFXzeGVM1hWVIhV5dZhdZ0cTG.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 展览招黑了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌝本期主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>湘湘、响姐、韩韩、阿猪</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>-Chancla,Oaty. - Búzios</span></p><span></span><p><span>-Chancla - Nuvem</span></p><span></span><p><span>-Valeria Szervánszky,Ronald Cavaye - The Rite of Spring, Pt. 1： The Augurs of Spring - Dances of the Young Girls</span></p><span></span><p><span>-Franz Liszt,Leslie Howard - Hungarian Rhapsodies S.244 - No.2 in C sharp minor ／ F sharp major, with cadenza for Toni Raab：Rapsodie hongroise II</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻收听方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>·您可以通过小宇宙APP、荔枝FM、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、爱发电订阅收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢铁铁的音乐支持</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢MR.福D的视觉设计</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmrJC2SmwL4F0R0GgoQsz0AYiR2v.m4a" length="100438743" type="audio/mp4"/>
