  <item>
    <title>EP.008 度娘，冬日综合症的解药有吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637c45ad5dbc72a30cc34593</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637c45ad5dbc72a30cc34593</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Nov 2022 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>冬日综合症伴上一个又一个难熬的时刻，再及时加入我们的压抑与不快，等于一整个扑面而来的绝望到底吗？不！这其实恰恰正是治愈我们自己的最好时机到了！一切挫折、恐惧、担忧、怀疑正在被唤醒，等待着被我们自己疗愈，并做出最正确而非最容易的回应…… 这一期我们的hā唠主播们唠中有emo，但欢乐依旧，来听听我们的不爽，也许会让同样不爽的你心里或多或少舒服些许…</span></p><span></span><p><span>这绝不算把自己的快乐建立在别人的痛苦之上，而是知道在emo的道路上没有人是孤独的，来一起抱团取暖吧～&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>I will try to fix you&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 度娘嘴中的更年期到冬日综合症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 吐槽大会之对创业的预想永远赶不上真实面对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> 吐槽大会之30+重返读书的心理斗争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 吐槽大会之让你一个人觉得孤单啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 为目标而感到压力与怀疑是正确的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> 自我疗愈的tips来来来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 吸宠物与吸孩纸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 提高幸福指数的美好植物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 带给自己生命力的运动不能停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">39:52</a> 我可能只是需要一个拥抱吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 换个角度加点儿幽默</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2596">43:16</a> 看剧放空也能找到平实安定的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a> emo弱鸡的时候就去睡吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2969">49:29</a> 阿猪为啥不来聊这期揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️本期主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>韩韩、响姐、湘颖</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬本期片单</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧：请回答1988</span></p><span></span><p><span>综艺：一年一度喜剧大赛</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚本期书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《改变你想法的101篇文章》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>My Mind &amp; Me - Selena Gomez</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能 - 李怡然同学&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>温柔的代价 - 旅行团乐队&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fix You - Coldplay&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>📻收听方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>您可以通过小宇宙APP、荔枝FM、喜马拉雅、网易云音乐、爱发电订阅收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧣微博：ha唠（欢迎大家在微博与我们互动）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📪邮箱：hallo42022@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️记得给我们留言哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期节目手绘封面来自韩韩</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢铁铁的音乐支持</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢MR.福D的视觉设计</span></p>]]></description>
